          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જિતાડવું — jitāḍvũ — \"to win it for (a team)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો આપણો કપ્તાન સારું રમત તો તે ટીમને જિતાડત. jo āpṇo kaptān sārũ ramat to te ṭīmne jitāḍat. If our captain had played well, he would have won it for the team."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે ટીમને જિતાડી, teṇe ṭīmne jitāḍī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જિતાડવું (jitāḍvũ) is built from જીતવું, \"to win\", with the causative -āḍ- and a shortened vowel: to make someone win. CDIAL files જીતવું under Sanskrit jita, \"won\" (CDIAL 5224)."
            }
          ]
        },
